{%- comment -%}
  Collection card — one template, rendered once per collection.

  **This is a single block, not one per collection.** The section holds the list
  of collections and renders this static block inside its own loop, handing each
  pass the collection it is for:

      {% content_for 'block', type: '_collection-card', id: 'collection-card',
                     closest.collection: collection %}

  So four collections show four cards from one set of settings, and the theme
  editor lists it once with the repeat mark. Anything that would have to differ
  per card — a title override, a chosen photograph — therefore has no place
  here; those come from the collection itself.

  Its name is underscored because it is **private**: a merchant never adds it,
  the section places it. Only its children are in an "Add block" list.

  **The children are placed by CSS, not by their order in the tree.** The design
  fixes this card's composition — the name and the count on one row, a hairline
  under them, the photograph below with the hover band over it — so each child
  claims a named grid area and adding or removing one switches that part on or
  off without rearranging the rest. The band and the photograph deliberately
  share the media area, which is how the band covers the photograph exactly
  while remaining a sibling a merchant can remove on its own.

  The rule is the card's own, not a block: it is the design's join between the
  head and the photograph rather than a part anyone would want to drop.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign collection = closest.collection
  assign url = collection.url | default: routes.all_products_collection_url
-%}

<a class="cat-card" href="{{ url }}" {{ block.shopify_attributes }}>
  {% content_for 'blocks' %}
  <span class="cat-card__rule" aria-hidden="true"></span>
</a>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "t:blocks.collection_card.name",
  "tag": null,
  "blocks": [
    { "type": "collection-card-image" },
    { "type": "collection-card-title" },
    { "type": "collection-card-count" },
    { "type": "collection-card-reveal" }
  ],
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
